From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 06:15:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings omit unavailable radio controls

This product has no Bluetooth or Wi-Fi hardware. Remove the Bluetooth and
Wi-Fi developer options and the media output switcher, and disable the
connected-device, Bluetooth and Wi-Fi activities, including their intent
routes, so no Settings screen or external intent reaches a radio page. The
connected-devices tile is no longer re-enabled at runtime.
---
 AndroidManifest.xml                           | 10 ++++++++
 res/xml/development_settings.xml              | 25 -------------------
 res/xml/sound_settings.xml                    |  9 -------
 .../android/settings/SettingsActivity.java    |  6 -----
 .../DevelopmentSettingsDashboardFragment.java |  8 ------
 5 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 48 deletions(-)

